We give you permission to reproduce this photo under the CC By Licence as requested.

Please note that three of the dinosaurs depicted, the Diplodocus unmounted, the Camarasaurus and the Allosaurus were discovered, excavated and mounted by the Sauriermuseum’s own staff.
The Camptosaurus was discovered by Bob Simon on a neighboring ranch, the Red Canyon near by Shell, Wyoming.

The Sauriermuseum Aathal developed a special mounting style which included part of the original matrix.

The Sauriermuseum donated these four dinosaurs and six others to the Zürich University in the year 2019.
The free standing skeleton of a Diplodocus is a cast (Replica).

